<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Queries the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/BITM%20base.xls" title="BITM base.xls">items</a> and <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Materialtypes.xls" title="Materialtypes.xls">material 2DAs</a> to get the stat modifier that a certain item has when equipped.
</p>
